[{"title":"贺洪景茂叶舍试平奏仍勉为南宫之行 其二","author":"王迈","text":"万仞浮屠已合尖，出门一笑谢齑盐。\n钓鳌沧海六连上，骑鹤扬州二得兼。\n谶应何仙符旧兆，梦魁余榜合新占。\n破荒吾邑须君辈，更看花从锦上添。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29590,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"归舟过桐江晚风不顺","author":"王迈","text":"长江渺渺雨濛濛，自在扁舟一叶中。\n欲识此行无可意，往来俱被打头风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29591,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戴老堂为城西林兄作 其二","author":"王迈","text":"环堵陈图史，高堂奉旨甘。\n桂枝和月种，萱草斗春酣。\n玉帝垣居北，老人星现南。\n重哉忠孝责，硬作脊梁檐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29592,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怀蒋力父监仓","author":"王迈","text":"冰结长江少跃鳞，天寒不见雁来宾。\n翻云覆雨羞馀子，霁月光风忆若人。\n丹穴鹓雏行毓瑞，北堂燕喜倍生春。\n万金消息何时到，一洗胸中万斛尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29593,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自赞","author":"陈郁","text":"年方九秩开，丹脸映碧眼。\n习静寸心安，味穷百事懒。\n由中以致和，闻道亦非晚。\n噫，十年撰述幸随龙，二圣在天应默眷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29594,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"制梅花汤","author":"陈郁","text":"南枝开处觅春光，摘得冰葩蜜瓮藏。\n留煮午汤消暑渴，吟骚牙颊有浮香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29595,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"为古艾郑子刚赋可轩 其二","author":"陈郁","text":"不容不办屋三间，出即扃幽退隐闲。\n我蔽一言君记取，黄扉未必似青山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29596,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"商驿楼东望有感","author":"陈郁","text":"山川去接汉江东，曾伴隋侯醉此中。\n歌绕夜梁珠宛转，舞娇春席雪朦胧。\n棠遗善政阴犹在，薤送哀声事已空。\n惆怅知音竟难得，两行清泪白杨风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29597,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"胡定斋惠墨求诗","author":"储泳","text":"万杵玄霜玉兔魂，刀圭炼就许平分。\n流珠轻滴银蟾露，化作催诗一片云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29598,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山中即事","author":"赵汝回","text":"白日荒荒过不知，荼蘼开了觉春归。\n山家卖笋樱桃熟，河水生萍柳絮飞。\n久雨一晴萤火出，闰年三月杜鹃稀。\n沉沉松竹烟岚冷，惭愧高僧借袷衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29599,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二月十九日","author":"赵汝回","text":"客去关门读庄老，灯花熠熠春虫小。\n冰雪未消雷雨来，长安三月行人少。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29600,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"佛顶菊","author":"史铸","text":"篱畔光明缘底盛，秋来千百化身多。\n露栖不必醍醐灌，雨沐何烦手掌摩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29601,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石菊 其二","author":"史铸","text":"干弱叶纤花特奇，艳浓九夏到秋时。\n枝头结实元为药，争奈越中人罕知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29602,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"菊花 其一","author":"史铸","text":"无艳无妖别有香，知心谁解赏孤芳。\n渊明酩酊知何处，安得斯人共一觞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29603,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄菊二十首 其一","author":"史铸","text":"黄花漠漠弄秋晖，伫立阶前香在衣。\n正色逢人何太晚，衰翁相对惜芬菲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29604,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"枯树","author":"赵时韶","text":"斧斤不死老苍虬，未肯甘心只么休。\n尚有阿婆三五态，背时涂抹趁风流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29605,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"恋梅","author":"赵时韶","text":"月下敲推夜未央，青鞋冷透不知霜。\n儿童促我且眠去，画在床屏亦有香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29606,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十四首 其十七","author":"释智愚","text":"奸峭互陈，对面千里。\n有人寄僧过夏，南山大开东閤，彼此出家儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29607,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古一百首 其二","author":"释智愚","text":"有三尺剑可以谒赵国，无千里眼难以见悬丝。\n巍巍堂堂，三界大师。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29608,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"布袋和尚赞 其二","author":"释智愚","text":"梦里升兜率，阎浮待下生。\n不须呈懵袋，亚毒已流行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29609,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"良遂见麻谷赞","author":"释智愚","text":"闭户复携锄，云深路更迂。\n须知形影外，肝胆向人输。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29610,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游金华洞天","author":"释智愚","text":"飕飕崖溜静边闻，到此仙凡咫尺分。\n鹤驾朝真何日返，洞门终日锁寒云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29611,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"演僧史钱月林","author":"释智愚","text":"浚发灵机口角边，断崖飞瀑逼人寒。\n若言列祖有传受，迦叶无因倒刹竿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29612,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宣知客归江心","author":"释智愚","text":"风帽云巾历所期，问津何似到家时。\n曲阑半倚垂杨外，潮落潮生祇自知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29613,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题净业图","author":"释智愚","text":"鍊行修身结佛冤，未曾说著齿先寒。\n老来不愿西方去，乐得阎浮眼界宽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29614,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"肃宗问忠国师十身调御图赞","author":"释智愚","text":"万乘垂衣立问端，国师答处太颟顸。\n谁知十月清霜重，一阵风来一阵寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29615,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庞居士大家团栾共说无生话图赞","author":"释智愚","text":"穷厮煎，饿厮吵。\n父子不同途，大家相脱卯。\n万顷湘江洗不清，无生曲调何时了。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29616,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古三首 其一","author":"释智愚","text":"金钟夜击九重城，六载归来改瘦形。\n待得众生心眼活，雪山依旧碧崚层。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29617,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪中夜吟","author":"释永颐","text":"乱书尘席散清辉，竹院香凝宿火微。\n客去藓阶黏冻屐，鸟迷庭树入寒扉。\n重阴覆野春耕阔，列炬明山夜猎归。\n灯下老翁吟复听，断崖冰折碎声稀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29618,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪中送僧还竹阁 其一","author":"释永颐","text":"白公竹阁云生晚，城市人归夜雪平。\n灯在北高峰顶上，塔如千尺玉长檠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29619,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"归练潭","author":"释永颐","text":"孤舟东下涉蘋溪，两岸幽花送客西。\n到得山房绿阴满，午窗犹有子规啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29620,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"看梅杂兴 其二","author":"释永颐","text":"挂头方帽与乌纱，兄自看梅弟煮茶。\n閒问水边行乐去，向阳浑有几株花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29621,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"松陵答友人","author":"释永颐","text":"郁罗天上挹星躔，拾羽编衣汎碧莲。\n长笛乱吹明月夜，秋风濯足太湖边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29622,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪","author":"赵葵","text":"玉龙昨夜起天涯，晓看团花一尺围。\n莫放妆台帘捲上，怕惊钗畔宝鸾飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29623,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟 其二","author":"赵葵","text":"橹声伊轧下滩来，惊起沙鸥去又回。\n小艇暂停曲江浒，推篷和雪看寒梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29624,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟 其三","author":"赵葵","text":"鼓棹过前湾，推篷破旅颜。\n山回流水转，烟逐晓云闲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29625,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"惠山寺","author":"赵葵","text":"古木森森映碧苔，嵯峨楼阁倚天开。\n山僧不问朝天客，自注冰泉浸野梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29626,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荒城 其一","author":"赵葵","text":"万里黄云冻不飞，碛烟烽火夜深微。\n胡儿移帐寒笳绝，云路时闻探马归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29627,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨后 其二","author":"陈元晋","text":"一雨郊原足，神功不作难。\n向知天道迩，今幸物情安。\n童稚沾衣走，人家傍户看。\n翻令五六月，春意转江干。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29628,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中觅句","author":"史弥宁","text":"舂锄似厌觅诗材，飞向溪心唤不回。\n赖有渔翁相尉荐，雨中撑得一篇来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29629,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"溪流","author":"史弥宁","text":"谁障溪流贴岸边，若为挽得上高田。\n机筒卷起倾横枧，竖笕盛来水接连。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29630,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和知宗喜雨 其二","author":"阳枋","text":"赫赫炎官未退藏，祈禳已尽别无方。\n忽施润泽环千里，再使荣华及百昌。\n未问民天无欠阙，且欣心地得清凉。\n一杯预作秋成庆，草草盘飧不用装。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29631,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再和知宗喜雨","author":"阳枋","text":"旱魃为灾百念关，瓢中一滴奈天悭。\n讲求碧玉仙科秘，叱起苍龙洞府间。\n神赐甘霖三日往，人欣和气一朝还。\n凭公大手为民贺，五色笺中蜀锦斑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29632,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三和知宗喜雨 其一","author":"阳枋","text":"蕴隆尤更觉天穹，谁道滂沱正伏中。\n风捲海潮雷助势，夜占星毕月移宫。\n黄云轇轕村村喜，碧玉淙琤处处通。\n前日勤民均此念，尊前一笑大家同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29633,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"见欧制干 其一","author":"阳枋","text":"殿西歌彻采薇声，记室烦君为一行。\n窦幕有班燕刻重，裴寮得愈蔡功成。\n文书昼静旌旗捲，筹画宵閒鼓角清。\n今日元戎前长史，步趋脚迹好门生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29634,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丁家洲","author":"阳枋","text":"水云留住觉无计，杞菊催归知有涯。\n百丈黄昏牵月色，长洲湾处宿丁家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29635,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"惊雷骤雨","author":"阳枋","text":"今年春晚天气寒，桃李村村犹未吐。\n豗击雷声送五更，江皋一阵催花雨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29636,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别王叔俨","author":"阳枋","text":"会得个中无两重，笑棚傀儡虚拈弄。\n水云佳处看回来，少听痴人多说梦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29637,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"方寺丞新第二首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"宅成天下借图看，始笑书生眼力悭。\n地占百弓多是水，楼无一面不当山。\n荷深似入苕溪路，石怪疑行雁荡间。\n只恐中原方鼎沸，天心未遣主人闲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29638,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梦中为人跋画两绝 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"花鸟皆诗料，江山即画图。\n暮归锦囊重，压杀小奚奴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29639,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读本朝事有感十首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"若纳希文受责均，前贤初岂有冤亲。\n暮生颍上还惆怅，引起无穷射羿人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29640,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"故襄师陈端明挽诗 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"部曲吞声惜，朝廷拊髀思。\n谁知钓璜叟，堪将渡辽师。\n无复湟中谷，空馀岘首碑。\n韩门翱湜在，行状与铭诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29641,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"明皇幸蜀图 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"失守文皇业，来听望帝声。\n向令曲江在，吾岂有兹行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29642,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无题二首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"夕烽一夕彻甘泉，铸印分弓玉座前。\n天狗如雷防急变，佛狸死卯竟讹传。\n汉家岂可无三策，胡运何曾有百年。\n渐觉风寒逼堂奥，寄声诸老急筹边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29643,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春夜温故六言二十首 其八","author":"刘克庄","text":"出入息顷冷暖，翻覆手间雨云。\n斩颐从教万段，卖颁不直分文。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29644,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题同班小录 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"周章鹤碧朝服，咫尺猩红御袍。\n风号先帝陵木，霜著孤臣鬓毛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29645,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题同班小录 其三","author":"刘克庄","text":"帐殿久移南内，桥山已隔西兴。\n同时谒帝评事，回首不忘茂陵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29646,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戊午生朝和居厚弟五绝 其三","author":"刘克庄","text":"□□□□□□□，□□□□□□□。\n□□□□□□从，晚福全输于少公。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29647,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"平舟场□□□□□□为郡人刘某言某有客曰玉□□□□□□一再班荆语而别余赠以二诗□□今□□有卢绳孙贡士过门余倒屣□□□□□平舟者乃其翁也","author":"刘克庄","text":"无正文。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29648,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"葵霍□□□□□□小诗还贽","author":"刘克庄","text":"州牧有佳客，□□□□□。\n爱吟老叉句，犹记照邻文。\n□□□□□，□□□□□。\n吾无恤孤力，怀旧意空勤。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29649,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大渊寄道冠汉镜各答以一首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"雁足传书至，蟾光出匣新。\n真从古冶子，曾照汉时人。\n昔作美年少，今非妙色身。\n明知皆梦幻，莫认假为真。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29650,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有感二首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"夷齐怨恶本不念，尧桀是非今亦忘。\n不知伍子嗔何甚，魄化为潮日夜忙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29651,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有感","author":"刘克庄","text":"向来涉笔赋长杨，辱赐天家七宝床。\n黄吻少年评宿士，白头宫女说先皇。\n走章台马曾游冶，攀鼎湖龙竟渺茫。\n纵使老婆强搽抹，安能更复入时妆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29652,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三赠月蓬道人 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"此蓬此月属谁哉，送汝挑包谒恕斋。\n说与同名同号者，龙图亲为判凭来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29653,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽惠倅黄德枢","author":"刘克庄","text":"无正文。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29654,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"□□□□ 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"□□□□□，□□□□□。\n□□□□□，□□□□□。\n□□□□□，□□□□□。\n□□□□□，□□□□□。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29655,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"□□□","author":"刘克庄","text":"□□□□□□□，□□□□□□□。\n□□□□□□□，□□□□□□□。\n□□□□□□□，□□□公徒太行。\n眼切于身存不得，可怜半世谩脩方。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29656,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题缺","author":"刘克庄","text":"少全。\n若论死生无愧怍，幅巾岂不胜貂蝉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29657,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢春谷畀地 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"微似锥刀亦苦争，使君诺重万金轻。\n希夷不以山分客，太傅曾将墅乞甥。\n季世炎凉几市道，古人生死见交情。\n与公到老宜同社，倡率乡人逊畔耕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29658,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送山甫赴岭口仓五言二首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"三子俱匏系，将如此老何。\n吾方期跨灶，汝勿厌熬波。\n食檗心尤苦，盐梅味主和。\n先民羞诡遇，不在获禽多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29659,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"罗浮寄公储子洪二兄四首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"城中冠盖匆匆散，老子空携影逐身。\n追路饯余三百里，斯人心事异他人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29660,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"罗浮寄公储子洪二兄四首 其四","author":"刘克庄","text":"若见子期烦问讯，二诗真可续坡仙。\n捷材渠似杂弦箭，涩思侬如上水船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29661,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻东轩讣 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"位逼将求说，书来欲铸颜。\n柰何化鹤去，不见珥貂还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29662,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"广游女 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"昔有吹笙侣，骖鸾上玉宸。\n奈何无欲地，著得有情人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29663,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"广游女 其三","author":"刘克庄","text":"振笛深宫侧，夫人若罔知。\n可怜东邻女，三载隔墙窥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29664,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]